???: [wait=1][speed=0.2][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Who...ahh... who goes there?
- (OBEY) The Goddess told me to come here. I want to join your church. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, you speak truly, stranger? [do Variables.mod_var("religious_fervour", 1)]
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]If so, your reasons are pure... Many come here out of desperation and fear, you know... 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Revolting, wretched lowlifes... Putrid leeches, the lot of them...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]If it were up to me, ahh, I'd set them all on fire...
	#angry sound
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Alas, The Goddess and our Elders are benevolent... They let almost everyone in, provided they're willing to leave their earthly possessions and sinful ways behind.
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]It is not my place to pass judgment, ahh, no, no, no...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Sinful old Joan will have to atone, punish herself for her momentary lapse of faith...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]But that's for later. Now, there's the matter of you...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, Goddess, merciful, almighty, and wise, is this indeed one of your chosen?
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Will they serve and praise, or are their twisted intentions hidden behind this pious facade?
	???: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_crow")][speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2].[wait=1].[wait=0.5].
	???: [wait=1.5][speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...Fortune smiles upon you, stranger!
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Very soon, we won't be able to let people in anymore... There just isn't enough space, food, or water... It saddens us all, ahh, deeply so...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]No one more saddened than I am... ahh, hee, hee...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]But you, ahh, you were handpicked by the Goddess Herself...
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...And is that the spark of Her Gift I see in your eyes? What a blessed day. What joy! 
	- That's, uh, great, I guess. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, so it is! 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She provides and cares for us all. And she will provide and care for you, too... => but1
	- Praise be!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, praise be, indeed!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She provides and cares for us all. And she will provide and care for you, too... => but1
	- Indeed. I am Her chosen one. 
		#add global variable, add new dialogue option in tutorial section
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, the Goddess very rarely speaks to us mortals. You've been blessed... [do Variables.mod_var("religious_fervour", 1)]
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Twice over, since She's also bestowed Her Gift upon you...
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]But don't let that turn your reverence and appreciation into vanity and pride!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]For if there's one thing Our Blessed Goddess truly hates, ahh, it's arrogance... => but1 
- (LIE) I just stumbled upon this place. I'm a weary traveler. I need a place to stay. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Our village is untouched by hardship... You're not the first to ask... [do Variables.set_var("lied_to_joan", true)]
