	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, Goddess, merciful, almighty and wise, what shall I do with this one? 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Will they serve and praise, or will they live as leeches and sow discord and doubt amongst our ranks?
