	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]My feelings are hurt, now... Do I not look like someone you can trust? 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Ahh, alas, I have to put this to rest... I am not one to forget, but I am one to forgive, as the Goddess tells us we should... 
